    "message": "Stage four-input prime filtering with ten proved finite checks\n\nReduce arbitrary natural inputs to 210 exact quotient/residue profiles and discharge ten canonical cases with kernel-checkable decision proofs. Transport the result to a coprime seven-power multiplier with literal folded-distance bounds and the higher-residue identity relative to each of five possible small multipliers.\n\nAll 20 sources pass local strict compilation. Independent review authenticates their source/object/import evidence and the statement scope. Add a fresh 20-module, four-contract, complete raw-occurrence axiom and exact stock-kernel gate; accepted registries remain unchanged. The higher two-input seed and full six-speed theorem remain separate unfinished work.",
